		<<else>>
			당신의 <<bottom>>【을를】 더듬고 꼬집는다.<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<garousal>><<arousal 6>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $farmland_dungeon.gauntlet_right is "snarl">>
